{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act44side_level_act44side_02_beg","storyGroup":"act44side","storySort":4,"storyDependence":"act44side_level_act44side_01_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"AT-2","storyName":"灵异特辑","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"星熊遇见了铁斋的儿子——与父亲关系不睦的哲也，还有在锻冶町生活的吉星。萌萌香因为不愿让电视节目影响锻冶町的声誉，惹上了更大的麻烦。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act44side/level_act44side_02_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act44side_02","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":2,"next":4,"characters":["衣着洒脱的青年","星熊","哲也","？？？","吉星","萌萌香","事务所所长","电视里的声音","澪","发愁的回收工","铁斋","油滑的记者","做作的记者","虚伪的记者"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_bg_64_g5_kajistreet_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":8},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1899_1#1$2","duration":"1.5","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":11},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衣着洒脱的青年","text":"那边那位女士，我好像没在锻冶町见过你。你是哪位？","id":12,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_npc_1899_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"有事吗？我家刚被一个陌生人折腾了一通，我要收拾一下。","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1899_1#1$2","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衣着洒脱的青年","text":"你没听最近的新闻吗？北方有人偷越边境，好像进了御机。","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_npc_1899_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衣着洒脱的青年","text":"我叫反町哲也，是金石会的人。麻烦告诉我你是谁。锻冶町的人我都熟悉，可从来没见过你这么一号人物。","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_npc_1899_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#5$1","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"哲也？难道......","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"不，一定是我想多了。","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"......","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"哲也，我是要回家。","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1899_1#5$2","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哲也","text":"你家？别开玩笑了。知道这座凶宅什么来头吗？","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_1899_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"金石会一代目会长的家，也是他的诊疗所。他是金石会最好的医生，救过许多人的命。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"他后来死了，这里就成了他女儿的家。","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1899_1#1$2","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哲也","text":"难道你要冒充他女儿？","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_npc_1899_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1899_1#7$2","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哲也","text":"等等......独角，这么高，这样的头发......你真的是星熊姐？","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_npc_1899_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"星熊“姐”？哲也，你——","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1899_1#5$2","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哲也","text":"——凶宅的怪谈真的和你有关？","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_1899_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#7$1","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我没有死，没有失踪，没有变成怪谈，我只是去了龙门。","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1899_1#4$2","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哲也","text":"谁能证明你说的话？","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8c/Avg_avg_npc_1899_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#7$1","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"去问铁斋叔。","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1899_1#4$2","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哲也","text":"我和他没什么好说的。","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8c/Avg_avg_npc_1899_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#7$1","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"哦，你是金兵卫那边的？那就去问他。别缠着我，我要回家祭奠父亲。","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1899_1#4$2","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哲也","text":"跟我一起去见三船先生，解释清楚之后你就可以回来了。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8c/Avg_avg_npc_1899_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#7$1","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"恕不奉陪。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":51},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_scabbard","id":52},{"type":"text","text":"眼前的年轻人抽出腰间挂着的木刀，对星熊摆好了架势。","id":53},{"type":"text","text":"见年轻人举起的不过是木刀，星熊重重地叹了口气，把般若放下，徒手对着眼前的年轻人。","id":54},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我们以前见过？","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1899_1#1$2","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哲也","text":"没有。","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_npc_1899_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"还是说，你觉得靠一把木刀就能打赢我？","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1899_1#1$2","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哲也","text":"......我听说过“金石会的青鬼”的故事。","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_npc_1899_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"那你？","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":65},{"type":"charslot","id":66},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":67},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#10$1","duration":"1","id":68},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"哲也？你怎么又和人打起来了？上次你把人给惹了，差点闹到动真刀，你还没长教训？","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1899_1#4$2","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哲也","text":"吉星，你别管。三船先生吩咐我的，让我最近留心陌生人。我得带这个人去三船先生那里。","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8c/Avg_avg_npc_1899_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#10$1","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"对面一看就不好惹，你怎么——","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":75},{"type":"charslot","id":76},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","duration":"0.5","id":77},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":78},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#6$1","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"你怎么连幽灵也要打呀！","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1899_1#1$2","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哲也","text":"......","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_npc_1899_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"......","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1899_1#1$2","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哲也","text":"你认识她？","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_npc_1899_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#4$1","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"昨晚萌萌香的演唱会上她突然出现，把萌萌香吓得半死。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1899_1#6$2","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哲也","text":"她真是幽灵？","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_avg_npc_1899_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#10$1","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"那倒不至于，哪有幽灵逃到最后被警察给逮捕的......难道说你越狱了？还是警察根本关不住你？","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我是被放出来的，谢谢！","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#4$1","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"嗐，没劲。","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"哲也，你也冷静点，别再拿着三船那家伙的羽兽毛当令箭了。","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"我知道你讨厌你爸，你也不想住回那座大宅子，可你至少得有个姿态，免得锻冶町的大家见了你就像见了什么疫病神一样——","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1899_1#5$2","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哲也","text":"吉星！","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_1899_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#3$1","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"......","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"所以铁斋叔......续弦了？还给你取了和他以前的孩子同样的名字？","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"他......对你和你妈不好？","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1899_1#5$2","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哲也","text":"以前我们俩还能吵起来的时候，我就问过他，为什么要娶妈。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_1899_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哲也","text":"他原来的老婆孩子和你亲爸一起被害了，他当成女儿来培养的你也不见了，他命里合该孤独终老，为什么还要来祸害我妈，祸害我？","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_1899_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":110},{"type":"text","text":"星熊瞪着年轻人脸上也瞪着自己的面具，发觉他对着自己，不像是对一个强敌......","id":111},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"唉。","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1899_1#4$2","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哲也","text":"你叹什么气？","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8c/Avg_avg_npc_1899_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#5$1","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"没什么，只是有点累了。","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1899_1#5$2","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哲也","text":"少虚张声势了！","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_1899_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":120},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"50,0","duration":"1","id":121},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":123},{"type":"text","text":"年轻人摆出标准的上段架势，试图从一个刁钻的角度欺近星熊。","id":124},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"-300,0","duration":"0.6","id":125},{"type":"dialog","id":126},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","volume":"1","id":127},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":128},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":129},{"type":"charslot","id":130},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_fist_01","x":"240","y":"-50","rox":"-250","roy":"150","roz":"-240","layer":"2","id":131},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punchsp2","volume":"0.7","id":132},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":133},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_fist_01","x":"240","y":"0","rox":"50","roy":"50","roz":"-240","layer":"2","id":134},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punchsp5","volume":"0.7","id":135},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":136},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":137},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1899_1#7$2","duration":"0.1","id":138},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown3","volume":"1","id":139},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"-250,0","posto":"0,-30","duration":"0.4","id":140},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":141},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":142},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.2","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哲也","text":"呃！","id":144},{"type":"dialog","id":145},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":146},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1899_1#7$2","duration":"0.3","id":147},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","power":"7","times":"30","duration":"0.5","id":148},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,-60","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","id":149},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哲也","text":"这是什么......无刀取？！","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"少看点漫画吧，这是最最基本的擒拿术。","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"冷静下来了吗？","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1899_1#1$2","focus":"n","id":155},{"type":"text","text":"年轻人没说话。即便有面具挡着，星熊也看得出，他稍微有点消沉。","id":156},{"type":"charslot","id":157},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"刚刚还憋着一股劲，也没必要这么快就灰心吧。技不如人，多练就是了。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1899_1#7$2","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哲也","text":"我哪里灰心了——不对，你怎么看出来我憋着......","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_npc_1899_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1899_1#4$2","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哲也","text":"......算了。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8c/Avg_avg_npc_1899_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"所以你和铁斋叔中间到底发生了什么？","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1899_1#1$2","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哲也","text":"别问我了，星熊姐。","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_npc_1899_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":168},{"type":"text","text":"年轻人把木刀挂回腰间，想摆摆手以示道别，却又拉不下面子。","id":169},{"type":"dialog","id":170},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","power":"5","times":"40","duration":"0.5","id":171},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":172},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"230,0","duration":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":173},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":174},{"type":"text","text":"原地站了一会儿之后，他僵硬地冲星熊点了点头，朝着町外的方向一瘸一拐地走去。","id":175},{"type":"charslot","id":176},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#4$1","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"那个，幽灵小姐？","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我叫星熊。","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#4$1","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"星熊，哲也是个笨蛋，但他人其实不坏。他只是和铁斋老爷子闹掰了，所以才去帮三船做事。","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"这阵子北院有人潜入御机的事到处流传，三船大概也是嫌他烦了，这才打发他在城里乱晃，抓什么北方间谍，他居然还真当回事。","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"就上午，金兵卫刚刚在锻冶町杀死一名手下，罪名是“擅闯锻冶町”。","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"看在哲也是铁斋叔儿子的分上，但愿金兵卫不会也一刀砍了他。","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#2$1","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"......","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"吉星，你这么年轻，怎么跑到锻冶町来住？","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#1$1","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"我继承了奶奶的店，店名就叫“吉星”。铁斋老爷子的小钢珠店就在“吉星”楼下，所以我也帮他看店。","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"一个人打两份工，忙得过来吗？","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#1$1","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"（耸肩）自从三船那混球宣布要开发锻冶町之后，町里几乎没什么人来逛了，我清闲得很。","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"那町里的居民对开发这件事怎么看？","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#2$1","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"怎么看？三船根本就没考虑过我们的意见。","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"他的人平时哪管什么“擅闯锻冶町”，来闹事的闹事，来赶人的赶人，我们一点办法都没有，铁斋老爷子想管也管不过来。","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"老爷子也就是握着锻冶町的地契，又是金石会的会长，不然三船早就得手了。","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"多谢你告诉我。","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#11$1","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"不谢。你要是回来住，我们还是邻居呢，互相帮助是应该的。","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/eb/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"顺便，你刚刚管三船叫什么？金兵卫？","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/eb/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"这是他发迹前的名字。","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#1$1","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"哈，好，以后我就这么叫他了。","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"不过啊，不过，幽——不是，星熊小姐，我其实很好奇你的事。你真的像怪谈里说的那样，二十年间到处追杀当年的仇家？","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"......抱歉，我有事要忙，现在没心情聊天。","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#11$1","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"没关系没关系，你先忙你的，反正我就在那边的小钢珠店待着，有空来找我啊。","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/eb/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"——哦对了，明天我要去神社给萌萌香祈福，后天还有花火大会，所以这两天别来啊，可能会扑空的！","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/eb/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"花火大会？","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"......的确，也到了该办花火大会的季节了。","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":221},{"type":"dialog","id":222},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":223},{"type":"charslot","id":224},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":225},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/eb/Avg_bg_64_g15_higashiroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":226},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":227},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":228},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":229,"musicid":1},{"type":"text","text":"狭小的房间里，萌萌香坐在一株看起来并不怎么健康的植物前。","id":230},{"type":"dialog","id":231},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#3$1","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"叶子好像又黄了几片，好在还有新叶发出来。","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"房间里的阳光还是太暗了，主干一个劲儿地往窗户的方向弯......唉。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#1$1","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"可别死啊，“叶助”。","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":237},{"type":"text","text":"植物旁边，从右到左，列着一整排让人摸不着头脑的东西。","id":238},{"type":"text","text":"一个空水缸，几个装了土却没植物的花盆，云兽爬架，中间还有个小小的电子终端，小到根本看不出是做什么用的。","id":239},{"type":"text","text":"而最左边是个封得严严实实的运动包，更看不出里面装着什么东西。","id":240},{"type":"text","text":"萌萌香刚要提起喷壶，电话铃声突然响了起来。","id":241},{"type":"dialog","id":242},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_telephonering","id":243},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#3$1","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"是澪小姐吗......？","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":247},{"type":"charslot","id":248},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_telephone","id":249},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":250},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"事务所所长","text":"是萌萌香吗？","id":252},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#10$1","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"所长？！","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a1/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"事务所所长","text":"萌萌香，多亏了你那个探访鬼屋的节目，现在电视台的收视率高到不行啊！你怎么一点都不兴奋？还没看那一期吗？","id":256},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#20$1","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"我本来就害怕，不想再看一遍......那个幽灵......","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"事务所所长","text":"那幽灵不也没拿你怎么样嘛！","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"事务所所长","text":"现在各大电视台都在转播你的新节目，论坛上也全都是关于恶鬼的讨论，其中不少还专门开设了回顾你往期节目的板块呢！","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"事务所所长","text":"我本来还在担心你的发展问题，现在终于可以完全放心了。全南院国民级的“怪谈艺人”几乎一定是你了。","id":262},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#20$1","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"我......","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"事务所所长","text":"好了好了，广告商一直在联系我们，想洽谈你代言产品的事。我先去应酬了！","id":266},{"type":"dialog","id":267},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_telephone","id":268},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":269},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":270},{"type":"text","text":"萌萌香绝望地环视狭小的房间，她的目光停在了电视机前。","id":271},{"type":"dialog","id":272},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_oldtvelectricity","loop":"true","channel":"tv","id":273},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":274},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"tv","fadetime":"1","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"锻冶町闹鬼！狭小的古巷，破败的商店街，无人修缮的路灯......","id":276},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#7$1","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"不对，不对......","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"（按下换台键）","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":280},{"type":"dialog","id":281},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_oldtvelectricity","loop":"true","channel":"tv","id":282},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":283},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"tv","fadetime":"1","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"恶鬼再度回归，原因是锻冶町冤死案件太多！","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"无人敢碰的锻冶町，今后将何去何从？","id":286},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#7$1","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"（猛烈地按下换台键）","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":289},{"type":"dialog","id":290},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_oldtvelectricity","loop":"true","channel":"tv","id":291},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":292},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"tv","fadetime":"1","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"人气艺人萌萌香在锻冶町遭遇生命威胁，所属事务所实控人三船发声——","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"“我代表金石集团向大家保证，我们一定会从根本上解决锻冶町的问题。”","id":295},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":296},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#1$1","id":297},{"type":"dialog","id":298},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"为什么会这样......之前的节目不是大家笑一笑就过去了吗？","id":300,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"怎么这一次反响这么大......我还答应吉星要为锻冶町出力，可这样下去......","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"现在该怎么办......怎么办？","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":303},{"type":"text","text":"萌萌香打开了论坛，无需她翻页，头版栏目全部与她相关。","id":304},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#20$1","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"不行，事情因为我变成这样，我必须自己正面做出回应......","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"叶助，你会支持我的吧？","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":308},{"type":"text","text":"叶助不说话。","id":309},{"type":"dialog","id":310},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$distressed_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_distressed_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":311,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":312},{"type":"subtitle","text":"大家好，我是羽生萌萌香。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":313},{"type":"subtitle","text":"关于锻冶町的节目，我有些话想和大家说。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":314},{"type":"subtitle","text":"大家都知道，我的第一部电影是在锻冶町拍的。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":315},{"type":"subtitle","text":"原来那里住着许多......喜欢任侠之道的人，所以偶尔会有些纠纷。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":316},{"type":"subtitle","text":"现在那里的人越来越少，只是一个安宁的老街区，根本就不是什么恐怖的地方了......","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":317},{"type":"subtitle","text":"......","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":318},{"type":"subtitle","id":319},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":320},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#3$1","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"......发布。","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#4$1","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"（深吸一口气）","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#9$1","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"明明平时和粉丝们互动都挺游刃有余的，这次为什么这么紧张......","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#6$1","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"希望可以帮到吉星和锻冶町吧，嘿嘿。","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"国民级萌萌香的事情，就先放一放吧——","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#2$1","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"点赞量涨得还蛮快的，嘿嘿......","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#10$1","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"欸？怎么突然停了......灰掉了？","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a1/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":334},{"type":"charslot","id":335},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_telephonering","id":336},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":337},{"type":"text","text":"铃声再次响起。","id":338},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#7$1","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"这次......是谁？","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":341},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_telephone","id":342},{"type":"text","text":"她跑到电话前，赶紧拿起了话筒。","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"喂？萌萌香吗？","id":344},{"type":"text","text":"电话那头是澪的声音，萌萌香能听出来，不同于往日冰冷的声线，澪在努力压抑自己的情绪。","id":345},{"type":"text","text":"可没等她回答，话筒那头突然换了个人。","id":346},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"事务所所长","text":"*东国粗口*，蠢女人，你疯了吧，发那种帖子干什么？","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"事务所所长","text":"帖子已经锁了，从系统里删反响更差，所以你赶快把那玩意儿给我删掉！","id":349},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":350},{"type":"dialog","id":351},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":352},{"type":"charslot","id":353},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":354},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_bg_64_g5_kajistreet_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":355},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":356},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":357},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_wasteland_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":358,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":359},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"呼，暂时就......这么多。","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"发愁的回收工","text":"不是“这么多”，是“堆成山”！","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"发愁的回收工","text":"假如我早点来，把你清理凶宅的过程拍下来发到城际网络，说不定还能火一把，赚点小钱。","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"发愁的回收工","text":"现在可好，都快下班了，突然来了一座垃圾山......唉。","id":365},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"这只是一楼和后院的量，二楼和地下我都没清呢。","id":367,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"发愁的回收工","text":"我的天。","id":369},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"不管怎么说，钱你先拿着。辛苦你了。","id":371,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"发愁的回收工","text":"好好好......欸？小判？","id":373},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"不能用了？还是找不开？","id":375,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"发愁的回收工","text":"你是有多少年没回来了啊，现在的钱早都纸币化了，听说御机最近还想跟锁川联合推无纸化交易呢。","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"发愁的回收工","text":"一两判值四千文钱，一是我找不开，二是我也不敢收，谁知道真的假的。","id":378},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"这......","id":380,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":381},{"type":"charslot","id":382},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":383},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1895_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":384},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"铁斋","text":"给你钱。","id":386,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_1895_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"发愁的回收工","text":"呦，铁斋老爷子。","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"发愁的回收工","text":"多谢您了，我这就找人把东西清走。","id":389},{"type":"charslot","id":390},{"type":"text","text":"回收工掏出终端，开始调度车辆和人员，而铁斋和星熊就在垃圾山旁边站着，两人都没有走的意思。","id":391},{"type":"text","text":"傍晚的空气沉闷，星熊看着眼前的垃圾山，思绪不由得飘回龙门。","id":392},{"type":"text","text":"如果旁边的人是Missy，她想必已经硬拉着自己往她家走了。","id":393},{"type":"text","text":"换成陈晖洁，她大概会二话不说撸起袖子，帮自己把地下室和二楼也清出来。","id":394},{"type":"text","text":"要是“灰色的林”，或者他的女儿......也许他们根本就不会允许一座好好的房子变成凶宅吧。","id":395},{"type":"text","text":"然而，身边的老人只是一言不发，清运车隆隆地开过来，垃圾山被整个搬上去，清运车又隆隆地开走。","id":396},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1895_1#1$1","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"铁斋","text":"房间里面还有你爸留下的东西吗？","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_1895_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我在一楼找过了，一件都没剩下。","id":400,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"铁斋叔，我刚刚遇见一个叫哲也的年轻人——","id":401,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1895_1#1$1","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"铁斋","text":"去我那住吧。这边太乱，你一天收拾不干净。","id":403,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_1895_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"......","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"不用了。我还是想在自己家多住上一阵。","id":406,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1895_1#1$1","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"铁斋","text":"也好。那我回家去给你抱床干净的被褥吧。","id":408,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_1895_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":409},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"麻烦铁斋叔了。","id":410,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":411},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1895_1#1$1","id":412},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":413},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":414},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"150,0","duration":"1.5","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":415},{"type":"delay","time":"1.6","id":416},{"type":"charslot","id":417},{"type":"text","text":"铁斋慢慢走远，星熊则望向后院的空地。","id":418},{"type":"text","text":"父亲去世时，御机尚未完全摆脱血峰战役后的混乱。","id":419},{"type":"text","text":"自己按照旧习俗将父亲火化，埋在后院，用上好的木料立了块碑，央求铁斋在上面刻了字。","id":420},{"type":"text","text":"这么多年过去，自己收拾后院的时候，这块碑倒仍然坚挺，甚至在满后院垃圾的包围下屹立不倒，但忙昏了头的自己根本没工夫管。","id":421},{"type":"dialog","id":422},{"type":"charslot","id":423},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.4","fadetime":"3","id":424},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":425},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":426},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1909_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":427},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":428},{"type":"dialogue","name":"油滑的记者","text":"“青鬼”小姐？！这不是“青鬼”小姐吗！","id":429,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1909_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"油滑的记者","text":"摄像老师！摄像老师，拍这边！这可是大发现！怪谈中的“青鬼”在锻冶町现身了！","id":430,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1909_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":431},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"......？","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1909_1#1$1","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"油滑的记者","text":"观众朋友们，我现在正在御机锻冶町为各位报道最新热点——复苏的青鬼！","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1909_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"油滑的记者","text":"时隔二十年，在昨日仁田街演唱会的一瞥过后，我们终于再次目击金石会的青鬼的身影！","id":435,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1909_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"油滑的记者","text":"她究竟是惟妙惟肖的模仿者，还是在人间徘徊的幽灵？抑或是在御机蛰伏二十年，其间杀害多人的冷面杀手？","id":436,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1909_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"油滑的记者","text":"不像是幽灵......幽灵应该是没有实体......没有影子的！可我们面前的青鬼小姐显然有影子！您好！我是金石台的小松！","id":437,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1909_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#7$1","id":438},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"啧。","id":439,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1909_1#1$1","id":440},{"type":"dialogue","name":"油滑的记者","text":"您的独轮车呢？","id":441,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1909_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":442},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"......独轮车？","id":443,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1909_1#1$1","id":444},{"type":"dialogue","name":"油滑的记者","text":"很多观众都认为青鬼的怪谈与轮入道的怪谈有关！许多青鬼的受害者都是在目睹轮入道之后遭遇不测，我想——","id":445,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1909_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":446},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":447},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":448},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":449},{"type":"text","text":"星熊不等记者说完就转身往旧宅方向走去，却只撞上另一个匆匆跑来的记者。","id":450},{"type":"text","text":"就像下水道里闻见了剩饭味的源石虫，四周的记者越聚越多。","id":451},{"type":"dialog","id":452},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":453},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":454},{"type":"dialogue","name":"做作的记者","text":"赶到了......终于赶到了！是青鬼！是青鬼没错！","id":455},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虚伪的记者","text":"青鬼小姐，我姓浦上！请问您为什么在二十年后重新暴露？是因为所有的仇怨都已经报完了吗？","id":456},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虚伪的记者","text":"艺人萌萌香小姐刚刚爆火的节目是否和您有关？","id":457},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#7$1","id":458},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"让开！","id":459,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1909_1#1$1","id":460},{"type":"dialogue","name":"油滑的记者","text":"青鬼小姐！只要您回答几个问题——","id":461,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1909_1$1.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$fightgeneral","volume":"0.5","id":462},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":463},{"type":"dialogue","name":"油滑的记者","text":"咕——","id":464,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1909_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":465},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","volume":"1","id":466},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-60","duration":"0.5","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":467},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":468},{"type":"charslot","id":469},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1895_1#6$1","duration":"0.5","id":470},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":471},{"type":"charslot","id":472},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":473},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1909_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,-60","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.5","id":474},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":475},{"type":"dialogue","name":"油滑的记者","text":"你竟敢打人？！","id":476,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1909_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1895_1#6$1","id":477},{"type":"dialogue","name":"铁斋","text":"锻冶町好歹也算我的私产，你们私闯进来，想好怎么向金石会谢罪了吗？","id":478,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_1895_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":479},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虚伪的记者","text":"是铁斋？！","id":480},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虚伪的记者","text":"这老头又臭又硬，而且真的会动手......走了！没必要和他硬碰硬！","id":481},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crowdrun","volume":"1","id":482},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":483},{"type":"text","text":"刚刚还聚成一团的记者，转瞬间又一哄而散。","id":484},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"3","id":485},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1895_1#6$1","id":486},{"type":"dialogue","name":"铁斋","text":"一眼顾不到，这些东西闻见新闻的味道就扑了上来。怪谈，什么怪谈？","id":487,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_1895_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"铁斋","text":"不过是赶了巧，住这栋房子的人接连倒霉，怎么就和你联系了起来，还成了什么怪谈......荒谬。","id":488,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_1895_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1895_1#1$1","id":489},{"type":"dialogue","name":"铁斋","text":"被褥拿好，酒也拿好。","id":490,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_1895_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":491},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"酒？","id":492,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1895_1#1$1","id":493},{"type":"dialogue","name":"铁斋","text":"折腾到这个时间，小贩什么的早都散了。要祭奠你父亲，没酒怎么行？","id":494,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_1895_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":495},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"......多谢了。铁斋叔也一起？","id":496,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1895_1#1$1","id":497},{"type":"dialogue","name":"铁斋","text":"我就算了。他就你这么一个女儿，我没照料好，是我有愧于他。","id":498,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_1895_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"铁斋","text":"能把你的般若重新铸好，就算是我对他的告慰了。","id":499,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_1895_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":500},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":501},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":502},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":503},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":504},{"type":"image","id":505},{"type":"charslot","id":506}],"characters":["衣着洒脱的青年","星熊","哲也","？？？","吉星","萌萌香","事务所所长","电视里的声音","澪","发愁的回收工","铁斋","油滑的记者","做作的记者","虚伪的记者"]}